          "description": "Number line from 2 to 5 with sixteen equally spaced ticks at intervals of one fifth. A is at 2½ and B is at 4⁷⁄₁₀, each located by a downward orange arrow halfway between adjacent ticks.",
          "mathematics": "Ticks have values 2 + i/5 for i = 0,…,15. A = 5/2 and B = 47/10.",
